    <time>1787766811</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update python-comfyui-workflow-templates-media-assets-01 to 0.1.35.

This package tracks its own PyPI distribution
(comfyui_workflow_templates_media_assets_01), not the parent repository's
0.11.x version line. 0.1.35 is the current release of that distribution.

Purely additive: five new preview images, one for each of the five workflow
templates added in this release cycle. No existing asset changes.

Staging: these four requests must land in the SAME staging project -- the
meta package python-comfyui-workflow-templates 0.11.48 raises its
BuildRequires and Requires floors onto the three new bundle versions, so
splitting the batch across stagings leaves it unresolvable.

Sequencing: please stage this together with, or after, SR 1373695, which
converts comfyui's exact &quot;=&quot; pins on this package family to floors. Until
1373695 is accepted, Factory's comfyui still requires
python3XX-comfyui-workflow-templates = 0.11.44, so a staging that takes this
batch without 1373695 will show comfyui broken in installcheck. All four new
versions in this batch (0.11.48, 0.3.322, 0.1.57, 0.1.35) satisfy the floors
1373695 introduces, so no comfyui spec change is needed.

Submitted together with python-comfyui-workflow-templates 0.11.48,
python-comfyui-workflow-templates-core 0.3.322 and
python-comfyui-workflow-templates-json 0.1.57.</comment>
    <requestid>1373739</requestid>
